Subject: [PATCH] Add 12 new tier-1 launches; refresh Heat index; count
 156->168

projects.json
- Added 12 new tier-1 projects:
  North: Godrej Aveline (Yelahanka), Sumadhura Panorama Ph2 (Devanahalli plots),
         Prestige Springwood (Devanahalli), Sattva Aeropolis (Devanahalli)
  South: Sattva Jigani (Jigani / near E-City)
  East:  Prestige Fernleaf, Prestige Ethan (both Prestige City 2.0 Sarjapur),
         Godrej Parkshire (Hoskote), Prestige Dalasagere (Hoskote NH-75)
  West:  Sobha Indraprastha (Rajajinagar), Brigade Horizon (Kumbalgodu/Mysore Rd),
         Casagrand Aquene (Kengeri)
- Status updates: Casagrand Promenade Yelahanka (Pre-launch -> Launched,
  price + units detail).
- Updated meta count 156 -> 168.

data/overheat.json
- updated 2026-06-18 -> 2026-06-21; mortgage rate 7.75 -> 7.80.
- Launch-mix indicator: sharpened to "Premium ~68% of Q1 2026 launches"
  (Cushman & Wakefield Q1 2026 MarketBeat); still amber.
- Asking-vs-registry indicator: refreshed note with Karnataka guidance
  value hikes (6-15% in Feb 2026, another 10-15% mooted for Apr 2026)
  as explicit froth-chasing signal; still red.
- Other indicators (inventory ~15mo amber, EMI/income green, housing
  GNPA ~1.3% green, registration volumes green) re-confirmed - no panel
  inversions vs Jun 18.
- Verdict rewritten to reflect supply-side amber tilt while demand
  fundamentals remain intact.
